{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And the angel of Elohim journeyed.</b> This was before 'speak to the children of Israel and they shall journey.' Its meaning is 'and he had already journeyed,' and I have already shown you many like this. And because these three verses are joined one to another, and each one has 72 letters, therefore we find in the books written as a sign of the secret of the Explicit Name. And in my opinion, because the number of the revered Name reaches 72 letters, as I shall explain in the pericope of Ki Tissa, therefore it is written thus. And in the Book of Raziel, one who wishes to make a dream inquiry reads at the beginning of the night the verse 'And it came to pass in the thirtieth year' (Ezekiel 1:1), for it has 72 letters." "<b>The angel of Elohim.</b> He is the great prince who goes in the cloud, and he is the one written about: 'and YHWH went before them by day' (above 13:21). And when this angel who went before the camp of Israel journeyed and went behind them, the pillar of cloud journeyed with him. And one who says that the angel of Elohim is the cloud — it appears to us, where do we find the pillar of cloud called the angel of Elohim? And if the angel is the pillar, why does it say another time 'and the pillar of cloud journeyed from before them'? And if one answers us that the reason is doubled — the usage of the holy tongue is not to double except prophecies and rebukes; but for a narrative, that thus the deed was, it is not proper to double."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:33.040528917Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}